noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:830f8c4f-0636-4616-8c04-14249e3ef128\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>On a skeleton near <a href=\"/wiki/Reithwin_Tollhouse\" title=\"Reithwin Tollhouse\">Reithwin Tollhouse</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-73&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-133</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p><b>Psalm, The Last</b>\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Mistress <a href=\"/wiki/Shar\" title=\"Shar\">Shar</a> spread putrid flesh across the table before me.\n</p><p>'Eat of my bounty!' She urged.\n</p><p>She pressed her bitter mouth to my ear, and her clawed hand to my loin.\n</p><p>'Take your pleasure!' She whispered.\n</p><p>Her tongue dripped poison into my mouth.\n</p><p>'Be quenched!' She cried.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>The <a href=\"/wiki/Harpers\" title=\"Harpers\">Harpers</a> near victory, our fates are writ.\n</p><p>Dark Goddess, we partake as you charged.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>On this great beast's flesh, let us feast!\n</p><p>Our loins and lips, let us ravish!\n</p><p>Of this poison, let us drink!\n</p><p>If darkness we must know, let us be gorged as it takes us.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201653\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.052 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.054 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1597/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 30026/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7905/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand 